dds nothing and nothing is double-counted: erp_gantries is empty, all three erp_lines totals are 0.00, and there is no airport surcharge (the trip originates at Jurong Point, not an airport).\n\nTo the driver: your explanation that 'navigation rerouted me' is a bare assertion with no artifact behind it. The bundle holds no traffic advisory for this trip window - EV-ADVIS-02849-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 with issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT - so the POL-RD-03 comparison cannot be run, POL-RD-03 is unavailable, and under POL-RD-08 an assertion that cites no evidence ID carries no weight. Because no advisory identifier is cited by your side as the basis of an exoneration, POL-RD-13(1) applies: the missing advisory is a gap in the bundle and not the contradiction POL-RD-10(5) describes, so it does not escalate this case. You were also billed exactly the distance the trace records (18.2 km), so there is no unbilled shortfall and no DRIVER_COMPENSATION under POL-RD-04.\n\nEvidence integrity, stated expressly as POL-GEN-02(3) and POL-RD-07 require: EV-GPS-02849 is IMPAIRED at the schema layer, weight 0.85, issue code GPS_GAP_SHORT_OR_OUTSIDE_WINDOW (a single 40.0 s gap across 0.4 km). It is NOT impaired for POL-RD-07 policy purposes: the gap is under 90 s, the straight-line step is under 500 m, and sampling holds at 10 s, so limbs (a) to (c) are unmet, no independent corroboration of the excess is required, and POL-RD-10(3) does not fire. The schema impairment is a confidence discount only: the deciding excess is carried by the trace at 0.85 (the trip record's actual_distance_km is a rounded copy of the same measurement and is not an independent carrier), so confidence is capped at 0.85 and the deviation finding survives the discount.\n\nNo POL-RD-10 trigger fires, so the case is ruled rather than escalated: the trip identifiers match across EV-TRIP-02849, EV-GPS-02849 and EV-FARE-02849; the trace is policy-clean; the timestamps agree and do not run backwards; every fare-breakdown line has a counterpart; and the refund of 6.31 is far below 150.00 and below charged_total. No referral is produced by any clause: POL-RD-06(c) needs an established repeat pattern (there is none) and POL-RD-09(4) needs an unmatched charge (there is none). The monetary effect of 6.35 does not exceed the 8.00 execution threshold, so this provisional ruling executes on issue. Either party may appeal once, within 30 days, under POL-GEN-04."
